(def-fns _ $ (erased alg0 : (erased (Nat) o a a2 t c x w n) (erased (Add o a2 t) p1) (erased (Add a a a2) p2) (erased (Add c a t) p3) (erased (Add x a w) p4) (erased (Add c n w) p5)
